      "role": "user",
      "content": "the model cut off at the end there. but basically, yeah, it's most of them on US passports. they'll be staying in hotels in each city, not just at the airport. can u finish that list? also, are there any specific \"hidden\" things we should look out for with the documentation, like certain types of proof of onward travel or stuff that often gets flagged at the desk?",
      "source": "evaluator"
